OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells on Sunday.
OL,7,FBreezier with some rain likely on
OL,8,FMonday and Tuesday, turning a little
OL,9,Fwarmer too.
